    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote Position is a single-player horror story where you must follow strange tasks given to you by your new remote supervisor. The tasks launch you deep into a mysterious rabbit hole. Gameplay includes environmental puzzles and combat survival sequences where you need to think quick! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks given to you by your strange new supervisor\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/ec3fa297d9423cb7e31a261ebb471918.poster.avif?t=1754404527\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/ec3fa297d9423cb7e31a261ebb471918.webm?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/ec3fa297d9423cb7e31a261ebb471918.mp4?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/8c7303824b0ca2ac83bd23ff4e9cfc96.poster.avif?t=1754404527\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/8c7303824b0ca2ac83bd23ff4e9cfc96.webm?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/8c7303824b0ca2ac83bd23ff4e9cfc96.mp4?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/62fb8060b3fdf4d01ead4bffd6440f0a.poster.avif?t=1754404527\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/62fb8060b3fdf4d01ead4bffd6440f0a.webm?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007310/extras/62fb8060b3fdf4d01ead4bffd6440f0a.mp4?t=1754404527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
